# Bath bomb 1: a butter yellow bath bomb, a ball 1.2 m across and 1.1 m tall (30 times life size), a little squashed, with a pressed seam round its middle.
# The sprinkle of tiny lilac flecks is the material's speckle pattern. Knee cover: jump it or go round; convex collider.
format 1
collider convex

Detail detail=0.4
    Material material=bath_bomb_yellow
        Intersection
            SmoothUnion smoothness=0.03
                Translate translation=(0, 0.52, 0)
                    Ellipsoid radii=(0.6, 0.58, 0.6)
                # The seam where the two halves of the mould met: a thin raised ring
                Translate translation=(0, 0.52, 0)
                    Torus innerRadius=0.03 outerRadius=0.57
            Plane normal=(0, -1, 0) height=0
